    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>ARTIFICIAL</strong> is a physics based first-person puzzle platformer inspired by Portal &amp; Half-Life series. The story takes place in the underground colony of the Asteroid 2031XT, which is in the process of being captured and transferred to the Earth's orbit. This operation is suddenly interrupted by the appearance of the Corruption - an alien hive mind entity which begins attacking the colonists and hunting down all the survivors. The game begins several months after this incident, with you - the player, returning from a scavenging mission, heading back to the last hidden base of the survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the environment, pick up and throw objects, sneak around enemies, control intricate physics-based mechanisms and learn how to survive in the underground colony of the Asteroid 2031 XT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It goes without saying that something in the colony went terribly wrong. You as a player, will be thrown in the middle of events, which will gradually reveal more and more about the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many obstacles and traps you will encounter on your journey several thousand meters underground. Some of them more intelligent than the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the world of ARTIFICIAL yourself!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through 3-5 hours of original story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, climb and crawl through dozens of handcrafted environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve physics based puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling, carrying and throwing almost any object you can find! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around your enemies! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/087e77feb2a8ecb18dc831c9e1d52f00.avif?t=1732319167\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>ARTIFICIAL</strong> is a physics based first-person puzzle platformer inspired by Portal &amp; Half-Life series. The story takes place in the underground colony of the Asteroid 2031XT, which is in the process of being captured and transferred to the Earth's orbit. This operation is suddenly interrupted by the appearance of the Corruption - an alien hive mind entity which begins attacking the colonists and hunting down all the survivors. The game begins several months after this incident, with you - the player, returning from a scavenging mission, heading back to the last hidden base of the survivors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the environment, pick up and throw objects, sneak around enemies, control intricate physics-based mechanisms and learn how to survive in the underground colony of the Asteroid 2031 XT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/b5821096c5127eabedff73f0fb0e0dbd.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It goes without saying that something in the colony went terribly wrong. You as a player, will be thrown in the middle of events, which will gradually reveal more and more about the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/264078faafcbcc254c5143bb63f7cbac.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many obstacles and traps you will encounter on your journey several thousand meters underground. Some of them more intelligent than the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.poster.avif?t=1732319167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.webm?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/e5079bfa5ecec1a02437749d6299b827.mp4?t=1732319167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience the world of ARTIFICIAL yourself!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through 3-5 hours of original story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, climb and crawl through dozens of handcrafted environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve physics based puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with your surroundings by pushing, pulling, carrying and throwing almost any object you can find! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maneuver around lasers, hide from turrets and sneak around your enemies! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904510/extras/087e77feb2a8ecb18dc831c9e1d52f00.avif?t=1732319167\" /></div></p>",
